WEBVTT

00:01.020 --> 00:03.952
I will now go over the examination rules.

00:05.024 --> 00:10.112
The win condition is to defeat
the Dantalion, a Depth-8 beast.

00:10.940 --> 00:13.712
Are you familiar with the Dantalion?

00:13.968 --> 00:16.176
It's a beast that can read minds.

00:16.704 --> 00:18.448
It largely resembles an ape,

00:18.448 --> 00:21.424
and it uses the third eye
on its forehead to read minds.

00:22.240 --> 00:24.224
It has a cunning and cruel nature.

00:25.008 --> 00:31.216
Seekers who have failed to defeat it have been
subjected to days of excruciating torture…

00:31.680 --> 00:34.384
That's enough. Thank you for the explanation.

00:35.056 --> 00:40.128
The Winged Knights and Blue Beyond
will be competing to defeat this beast.

00:40.656 --> 00:45.664
Whichever party takes out the Dantalion first
will be deemed the winner.

00:45.952 --> 00:51.312
Would it be permitted to take out
the opposing party before the Dantalion, then?

00:51.664 --> 00:54.032
We don't kill on principle.

00:54.032 --> 00:55.616
We've never broken that rule.

00:55.850 --> 00:58.272
That's part of our integrity.

00:58.464 --> 01:00.128
Don't worry.

01:00.350 --> 01:04.752
We'll allow interference
with the other party, but no murder.

01:05.088 --> 01:06.960
And once an opponent is down,

01:06.960 --> 01:09.056
no further attacks will be permitted.

01:09.488 --> 01:13.024
Restraints may only be used
in areas where beasts don't appear.

01:13.120 --> 01:15.488
Those are the ground rules.

01:15.760 --> 01:20.352
I will be surveilling you throughout
the exam with a skill of mine,

01:20.352 --> 01:22.352
so I'll know the second anyone breaks a rule.

01:22.640 --> 01:24.272
There should be no problem, then.

01:24.704 --> 01:27.168
What about interference before the exam?

01:27.648 --> 01:30.032
I want to make that rule more clear.

01:30.416 --> 01:31.472
Why is that?

01:31.856 --> 01:36.432
That elf nearly got violent with me the other day.

01:36.432 --> 01:38.832
I'm concerned for my safety.

01:39.056 --> 01:40.768
She might try a sneak attack…

01:41.184 --> 01:44.992
I'm really sorry about
what happened that night, Noel.

01:45.632 --> 01:46.832
I hope you can forgive us.

01:47.050 --> 01:49.504
You think I can believe that?

01:50.840 --> 01:52.608
What I want is simple.

01:53.056 --> 01:56.256
Rather than merely prohibiting
interference before the exam,

01:56.752 --> 02:02.256
I want it to be a condition that all members
are present and in good condition on the day.

02:03.696 --> 02:07.040
In that case, I'll add that to the rules.

02:07.840 --> 02:11.024
Lastly, this exam is a special measure.

02:11.024 --> 02:12.544
There will be no do-overs.

02:12.860 --> 02:17.056
Therefore, I'll need to make sure of your resolve.

02:17.600 --> 02:21.952
Whichever party loses this exam must disband.

02:24.176 --> 02:28.672
You will also not be permitted to work
with the same members in the future.

02:29.216 --> 02:32.880
Breaking this rule will result in
revocation of your Seeker qualifications.

02:33.488 --> 02:36.816
If you accept these conditions, please sign here.

02:44.800 --> 02:47.184
I've received your consent.

02:47.304 --> 02:50.000
The exam will begin at noon in three days.

02:50.496 --> 02:55.952
Noel, this may sound arrogant,
but we're above you in terms of skill.

02:56.512 --> 03:00.144
But you seem to have capabilities
that defy common sense.

03:00.944 --> 03:02.864
So I won't let my guard down.

03:02.864 --> 03:04.704
I'll give this challenge my best.

03:06.352 --> 03:08.880
I'll give you one useful fact.

03:10.032 --> 03:14.432
I ranked up the other day and got new abilities.

03:15.296 --> 03:19.376
As a Strategist, I have such accurate
prediction skills that I can see the future.

03:19.536 --> 03:20.992
What's your point?

03:21.440 --> 03:22.496
I can see it.

03:22.960 --> 03:28.096
You'll be sobbing at my feet once you lose.

03:30.192 --> 03:31.728
I'm looking forward to this,

03:32.208 --> 03:33.328
Blue Beyond.

05:06.160 --> 05:09.632
Winged Knights and Blue Beyond.

05:10.080 --> 05:13.824
I'm glad to see you could all make it today.

05:14.304 --> 05:17.808
Both of your parties will delve
into the Abyss today

05:17.808 --> 05:21.536
and defeat the Dantalion at its core.

05:25.440 --> 05:27.568
Let the exam begin!

05:37.392 --> 05:38.416
Noel?

05:39.504 --> 05:42.096
What are you doing?

05:42.272 --> 05:44.688
Can't you see? We're having lunch.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.528
I don't understand.

05:46.528 --> 05:48.190
This is a competition.

05:48.190 --> 05:50.384
There's no time to relax and eat lunch.

05:50.608 --> 05:52.864
We can't fight on empty stomachs.

05:53.264 --> 05:56.016
Haven't you heard that haste makes waste?

05:57.760 --> 05:58.781
You…

05:58.880 --> 06:02.896
I'll let the party with the higher skill
have the first try.

06:02.896 --> 06:04.272
Go on ahead.

06:05.200 --> 06:06.440
- I've just about had enough of your…

06:06.440 --> 06:08.208
- Don't engage with him, Leon.
- I've just about had enough of your…

06:09.200 --> 06:13.936
If we're being pitted against a weaker group,
the inspector's impression of us must be awful.

06:14.816 --> 06:17.312
We're the ones who can't afford to waste time.

06:18.496 --> 06:19.312
Okay.

06:20.048 --> 06:22.592
I'm disappointed in you, Noel.

06:30.864 --> 06:33.488
First wave coming in approximately five minutes.

06:33.648 --> 06:35.664
All right. Let's intercept them here.

06:36.016 --> 06:37.632
All of you, prepare for combat.

06:38.176 --> 06:40.064
Can I say something first?

06:40.992 --> 06:44.032
I didn't want to bring it up at a time like this…

06:44.800 --> 06:46.880
But I want to discuss it while we have the chance.

06:47.648 --> 06:51.136
Noel Stollen came to speak with me the other day.

06:52.560 --> 06:59.216
He told me awful lies and asked me
to betray the Winged Knights.

06:59.216 --> 07:00.272
What?!

07:00.592 --> 07:02.272
I declined, of course.

07:02.608 --> 07:07.712
But I wondered if he hadn't said
the same thing to anyone else.

07:08.192 --> 07:10.000
He came to me too.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.608
O-Of course I said no!

07:12.608 --> 07:15.136
I could never betray all of you!

07:15.392 --> 07:17.808
Actually, he came to me too.

07:18.928 --> 07:23.984
So Noel tried to tempt all of us but me?

07:24.304 --> 07:28.384
Ridiculous, right? We'd never betray our friends.

07:28.720 --> 07:34.368
He claimed he would give me
"freedom" in return. How nonsensical.

07:34.624 --> 07:35.776
I know, right?

07:35.776 --> 07:39.504
It's so ridiculous, it's not even funny.

07:40.160 --> 07:41.392
Don't worry about it.

07:41.392 --> 07:45.872
He just wanted to instill doubt in us
to wear down our morale.

07:46.160 --> 07:48.832
He does such dirty things.

07:48.976 --> 07:51.808
I'm glad we cleared this up.

07:51.808 --> 07:54.593
Yeah. We'd never betray the Black Knights…

07:54.820 --> 07:57.896
That is, we'd never betray you, Leon.

07:59.408 --> 08:00.480
I know.

08:02.352 --> 08:04.416
The enemy vanguard picked up speed!

08:04.416 --> 08:05.504
Here they come!

08:07.632 --> 08:09.248
Holy Shield!

08:16.496 --> 08:20.496
First of all, good job. However…

08:20.960 --> 08:24.400
You went too far in giving them fake letters.

08:24.608 --> 08:27.440
You're the one who approved of my plan.

08:27.760 --> 08:32.304
I never gave you permission
to impersonate the guild.

08:32.592 --> 08:34.848
Will you disqualify me, then?

08:36.304 --> 08:39.744
You're a cunning boy, Noel.

08:39.744 --> 08:40.992
Thanks.

08:42.336 --> 08:43.648
Can you win?

08:43.792 --> 08:44.832
I'll win.

08:44.928 --> 08:49.376
That's how Overdeath taught me to fight.

08:50.800 --> 08:52.576
Are you sure about this?

08:53.024 --> 08:57.280
What if the Winged Knights get ahead of us?

08:57.808 --> 09:00.464
I told you, this is part of the plan.

09:00.880 --> 09:04.224
They're strong. That's why we need to wait.

09:04.352 --> 09:05.552
What do you mean?

09:05.856 --> 09:10.640
Out of all the Winged Knights,
Leon's a very talented leader.

09:11.440 --> 09:15.408
Not only is he good at fighting,
he has good awareness of the fight around him.

09:15.664 --> 09:19.104
On top of that, he has the Angel Wings ability.

09:19.392 --> 09:21.952
He was born with a faster MP flow than average,

09:22.064 --> 09:25.376
so he can activate skills
as quickly as he can think.

09:26.000 --> 09:28.960
What he has is a heaven-sent gift
if there ever was one.

09:30.784 --> 09:31.504
But…

09:31.920 --> 09:35.232
His outstanding talent can be his Achilles' heel.

09:35.888 --> 09:37.856
Especially with a personality like that.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.232
Why?

09:39.280 --> 09:42.944
He won't compromise on either
certain victory or doing the right thing.

09:43.216 --> 09:45.088
What's wrong with that?

09:45.582 --> 09:49.168
The Winged Knights will show you soon enough.

09:49.760 --> 09:53.584
Don't worry. We'll win. I'm sure of it.

09:57.872 --> 09:59.328
The seeds have been sown.

09:59.504 --> 10:04.816
I've told the three apart from Leon
about what's sure to happen.

10:05.952 --> 10:08.336
The Winged Knights will fall apart.

10:08.768 --> 10:10.960
Because Leon is going to betray them.

10:12.000 --> 10:14.992
[XI - The Cost of Doing What's Right]

10:20.000 --> 10:22.400
What're you up to?

10:22.400 --> 10:24.000
You can't intimidate me.

10:24.448 --> 10:26.912
Remember the competition rules?

10:27.392 --> 10:29.904
Are you saying this isn't interference?

10:30.304 --> 10:31.504
Of course I am.

10:31.680 --> 10:36.560
The rule is that all members have to
be present in good condition on the day.

10:37.184 --> 10:40.288
Non-hostile contact beforehand
isn't against the rules.

10:40.528 --> 10:43.408
So you can't use violence to drive me away.

10:44.336 --> 10:47.120
Is this why you asked for that rule?

10:48.432 --> 10:49.152
Keim.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.872
Betray the Winged Knights.

10:57.648 --> 11:00.496
Are you trying to make me laugh myself to death?

11:00.496 --> 11:01.648
I'm serious.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.784
What do I get in return, then?

11:04.784 --> 11:07.824
Money? Land? Hot chicks?

11:08.000 --> 11:10.624
Freedom. I'll give you freedom.

11:12.032 --> 11:13.104
Freedom?

11:13.216 --> 11:17.232
It must be painstaking,
having to follow someone special.

11:20.016 --> 11:23.120
Leon is a natural-born Seeker.

11:23.120 --> 11:24.957
And not just an average one.

11:25.340 --> 11:28.624
As his best friend from childhood,
you should know that better than anyone.

11:29.408 --> 11:31.424
The Winged Knights are uneven.

11:31.712 --> 11:37.120
If you go on to become a clan, it won't
be long before you can't keep up with Leon.

11:37.792 --> 11:41.248
No matter how hard you work,
you'll never match up to inborn talent.

11:41.664 --> 11:44.896
All that's in your future is despair.

11:45.168 --> 11:46.064
Keim…

11:46.430 --> 11:47.536
Free yourself.

11:48.160 --> 11:49.632
Now's your chance.

11:55.824 --> 11:57.792
You're right.

11:58.080 --> 11:59.728
We're uneven.

12:00.144 --> 12:02.640
But even then, I want to support him.

12:03.440 --> 12:05.856
It's my job as the big brother.

12:06.208 --> 12:08.192
Are you sure you're okay with that?

12:08.512 --> 12:10.800
Freedom isn't what I want.

12:11.792 --> 12:16.192
If you don't betray Leon, he'll betray you first.

12:28.160 --> 12:30.016
Keim! Take care of Vaclav!

12:30.016 --> 12:30.848
Got it!

12:30.848 --> 12:31.984
Sorry!

12:32.096 --> 12:33.440
Ophelia, defense!

12:33.440 --> 12:34.128
Roger!

12:34.480 --> 12:36.368
Toys! Toys!

12:36.368 --> 12:38.624
So many to play with!

12:39.000 --> 12:40.432
- Rip! Crush! Kill!

12:40.432 --> 12:42.208
- We've been fighting the Dantalion
for an hour already.
- Rip! Crush! Kill!

12:42.208 --> 12:43.872
- We've been fighting the Dantalion
for an hour already.

12:44.080 --> 12:45.888
We wiped out its underlings,

12:46.048 --> 12:48.352
but we're clearly at a disadvantage.

12:49.760 --> 12:52.656
Summon Fire Spirit! Phlogiston!

12:55.744 --> 12:56.752
It predicted me!

12:57.776 --> 12:58.800
Useless.

12:59.952 --> 13:01.392
It's a mind-reading beast.

13:01.872 --> 13:03.184
We can't sneak attack it.

13:03.808 --> 13:06.160
But with my Angel Wings…

13:09.440 --> 13:11.072
Divine Impact!

13:13.760 --> 13:14.896
One more hit!

13:17.824 --> 13:19.584
All of you! Dodge!

13:25.680 --> 13:28.384
Are you sure we shouldn't move, Noel?

13:28.736 --> 13:29.820
Don't be hasty.

13:29.820 --> 13:32.896
Once they've fought their hardest
and realized their limits…

13:33.184 --> 13:34.464
Then we'll go in.

13:45.888 --> 13:47.040
Ophelia!

13:48.096 --> 13:54.096
Toys… So fun… To smash…

13:54.230 --> 13:55.648
Everyone, stand back!

13:55.904 --> 13:57.664
I'll fight!

13:57.792 --> 13:59.136
Holy Shield!

13:59.136 --> 14:00.240
Iron Will!

14:02.480 --> 14:04.400
Toys strong.

14:04.400 --> 14:07.792
But only you really strong.

14:08.640 --> 14:11.856
I see fear, worry…

14:13.872 --> 14:17.152
That's a lame attempt to intimidate, chimp.

14:17.248 --> 14:19.488
No use acting brave.

14:19.488 --> 14:23.360
Your heart say, "We can't win."

14:23.456 --> 14:25.840
That's true. We can't win right now.

14:25.920 --> 14:28.704
But a Seeker never gives up!

14:29.440 --> 14:31.856
Even if we lose once, we'll win in the end!

14:32.032 --> 14:33.488
Invincible!

14:40.432 --> 14:43.168
Hey! Where are you?

14:43.168 --> 14:45.328
Hey! Hey!

14:48.096 --> 14:49.056
Can you move it?

14:50.528 --> 14:51.872
I still have feeling in it.

14:51.872 --> 14:53.872
But I don't think I can draw my bow.

14:54.032 --> 14:55.328
I'm sorry, Leon.

14:55.632 --> 14:56.480
Don't worry.

14:57.088 --> 14:58.624
We haven't lost yet.

15:00.780 --> 15:01.888
- Listen, everyone…

15:01.888 --> 15:02.880
- Hear me out.
- Listen, everyone…

15:03.376 --> 15:04.736
I have an idea.

15:05.696 --> 15:08.629
I'll be the decoy and draw it out.

15:09.152 --> 15:13.552
When I do, use your ultimate
Knight skill, Seraphim Blade.

15:15.056 --> 15:16.848
No! It's too risky!

15:17.184 --> 15:20.240
Because it would use all your MP in one move?

15:20.720 --> 15:23.856
No! The issue is the attack radius.

15:24.096 --> 15:25.376
It would hit all of you!

15:25.984 --> 15:27.616
That's why I'd be a decoy.

15:28.192 --> 15:33.232
This barrier Vaclav set up
is hiding us from the beast.

15:33.696 --> 15:38.320
But if you used a powerful attack,
the shock waves would destroy the barrier.

15:38.944 --> 15:40.336
We can't surprise it from here.

15:40.736 --> 15:41.984
That doesn't mean…

15:41.984 --> 15:43.984
Remember, Leon.

15:44.384 --> 15:47.888
The battle with the Aiatar that gave us our name.

15:57.024 --> 15:59.552
Hey! Hey!

15:59.776 --> 16:03.440
I'll be the decoy and draw it out as far as I can.

16:04.000 --> 16:06.928
Don't worry. I'm not trying to get myself killed.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.744
I'll dodge just like I did then.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.920
Trust me, Leon.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.008
I can't.

16:19.568 --> 16:21.280
This isn't like back then.

16:22.016 --> 16:23.760
The Dantalion can read minds.

16:24.352 --> 16:26.464
It'll know you're a decoy.

16:26.464 --> 16:27.808
Then what do we do?

16:28.096 --> 16:29.952
If we give up, we're disqualified.

16:29.952 --> 16:31.888
The Winged Knights will have to disband,

16:31.888 --> 16:33.504
and we'll have to split up!

16:34.592 --> 16:35.696
There's one thing.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.560
One thing that might work.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.664
Let's team up with Blue Beyond.

16:43.808 --> 16:47.312
If we work with them, we can defeat the Dantalion.

16:47.936 --> 16:50.208
We won't have to sacrifice anyone.

16:50.208 --> 16:53.280
Wait! What about the exam?

16:53.968 --> 16:56.720
Let's give up on the exam.

16:57.536 --> 17:00.080
If we work together to achieve the goal,

17:00.512 --> 17:02.730
maybe we won't be recognized as a clan,

17:02.730 --> 17:05.312
but at least he shouldn't
make us disband as a party.

17:08.144 --> 17:12.736
If you don't betray Leon, he'll betray you first.

17:12.912 --> 17:16.144
No way. It's just like he said.

17:16.144 --> 17:19.216
So this is what he meant.

17:19.936 --> 17:20.736
What do you…

17:20.736 --> 17:22.352
Are you serious, Leon?

17:22.464 --> 17:25.648
Blue Beyond is our enemy!

17:25.648 --> 17:27.210
The enemy we need to beat!

17:27.210 --> 17:27.770
- Why would we…

17:27.770 --> 17:29.264
- What else can we do?
- Why would we…

17:29.664 --> 17:33.040
I'll protect all of you as the leader
without sacrificing anyone!

17:33.200 --> 17:35.504
It's the right thing to do!

17:35.648 --> 17:37.552
It's always the same thing with you!

17:37.552 --> 17:40.608
How can you talk about
the right thing at a time like this?

17:42.112 --> 17:43.840
Calm down, Keim.

17:44.144 --> 17:45.488
What's gotten into you?

17:45.664 --> 17:45.968
- This isn't like…

17:45.968 --> 17:47.424
- I am calm!
- This isn't like…

17:47.808 --> 17:50.448
I'm taking all of us into consideration!

17:50.864 --> 17:52.144
But you…

17:52.368 --> 17:56.608
You believe in our enemy,
Noel Stollen, more than me?!

17:59.968 --> 18:04.048
I do. I believe in Noel more than you.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.280
I see.

18:08.048 --> 18:10.688
So that's your answer.

18:17.216 --> 18:19.104
He was right.

18:20.480 --> 18:21.664
The traitor…

18:22.592 --> 18:23.488
…is you.

18:25.792 --> 18:28.768
Don't worry. I didn't hit a fatal spot.

18:33.232 --> 18:35.120
Keim…

18:35.360 --> 18:38.896
Leon, I've always envied you.

18:39.792 --> 18:42.880
You have talent that I don't,
and I resented you for it.

18:43.984 --> 18:46.400
But you're a little brother to me.

18:46.992 --> 18:48.144
You're my friend.

18:48.608 --> 18:52.368
I was able to keep going
because I thought you believed in me.

18:53.232 --> 18:58.896
I wasn't even afraid to risk death
if it was for your sake.

19:00.656 --> 19:02.128
But I can't anymore.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.064
I can't.

19:04.928 --> 19:08.496
I want… to be free.

19:10.624 --> 19:12.176
Found you!

19:15.520 --> 19:20.464
Thanks for clearing the way, Winged Knights.

19:22.144 --> 19:27.648
Toys, toys! New toys!

19:27.936 --> 19:29.856
Nice to meet you, Dantalion.

19:30.224 --> 19:31.984
I'm Noel Stollen.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.016
Noel, Noel!

19:34.016 --> 19:36.016
My toy!

19:36.336 --> 19:40.112
Sorry, but I won't be your toy.

19:40.672 --> 19:43.152
Fight me to the death, chimp!

19:47.040 --> 19:47.680
[Morale Boost]
- Koga! Go!
- Roger!

19:47.681 --> 19:48.641
- Koga! Go!
- Roger!

19:54.112 --> 19:56.480
You… Why?

19:56.768 --> 19:58.144
Do it like we practiced.

19:58.624 --> 20:00.064
Calm and Serene.

20:03.776 --> 20:04.864
Why?

20:04.864 --> 20:09.600
Attacks… same speed as… thoughts!

20:09.888 --> 20:12.720
Activating a skill at the speed of thought…

20:13.280 --> 20:15.824
Only Leon can do that with Angel Wings.

20:16.736 --> 20:18.329
But we've practiced using Link to share our
intentions and fight without conscious thought.

20:18.330 --> 20:23.072
[Thought Sharing]
But we've practiced using Link to share our
intentions and fight without conscious thought.

20:25.696 --> 20:27.280
Garmr Bullet!

20:31.104 --> 20:34.288
That's a ten million fil bullet for you!

20:34.288 --> 20:36.704
You… Why?

20:36.912 --> 20:38.816
You think, but…

20:39.168 --> 20:42.416
Can't read mind…

20:42.896 --> 20:48.624
A Strategist's super-accelerated thinking
far outspeeds the Dantalion's cognitive capacity.

20:49.024 --> 20:52.864
My thoughts are too fast for it
to parse them as meaningful.

20:53.600 --> 20:57.424
Looks like you're the one
who's getting toyed with.

20:57.424 --> 20:59.648
Kill you, kill you, kill you!

20:59.856 --> 21:02.512
Kill you!

21:02.592 --> 21:03.296
Koga!

21:03.552 --> 21:05.024
Crazy Cherry Blossoms!

21:06.800 --> 21:08.128
Predicted.

21:13.488 --> 21:15.136
Too many thoughts!

21:15.136 --> 21:16.752
Head hurts!

21:16.752 --> 21:20.784
I switched to high-speed parallel
trains of thought.

21:21.168 --> 21:25.184
It must be a bit noisy for a mind-reader like you.

21:31.328 --> 21:34.736
You… You pay!

21:34.992 --> 21:37.312
You pay!

21:40.176 --> 21:44.704
Now… Head no hurt…

21:47.104 --> 21:49.248
Die!

21:49.424 --> 21:52.000
Order. Shoot it to death, Alma.

21:52.096 --> 21:53.184
Got it.

21:54.752 --> 21:57.264
Accel Duodecuple!

23:35.024 --> 23:40.070
[XII - This Snake Has Wings]
